@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+# `xui-components` — built-in widget library
+
+A reusable widget set built on top of `xui`. Each widget is a `#[component]`
+with typed props and a builder, so call sites use them through the `xui!` macro
+just like user components.
+
+## Widgets
+
+| Module | Component | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `button` | `button` | `ButtonVariant` (Primary/Secondary/Outline), `on_click`, label/text children, activate command. |
+| `input` | `input` | wraps `xui::widgets::text_input`; `TextController`, `style`/`input_style`, `padding`, `ComponentSizing`/`ComponentInsets` defaults. |
+| `dropdown` | `dropdown` | `DropDownItem` list, `on_change: Callback<usize>`, disabled items. |
+| `tabs` | `tabs` | `TabItem` (id + label `ElementDesc` + content), `on_change`, keyboard nav commands (previous/next/first/last). |
+| `image` | `image` | loads from `AssetId` or URL/path via `load_image_asset`; decodes with `zune-image` (jpeg/png). |
+| `icon` | `icon` | `IconData` from fill/stroke path or embedded SVG; `PathBuilder`, `LineCap`/`LineJoin`. |
+| `virtual_list` | `virtual_list` | only materializes rows near the viewport; `VirtualItemRenderer = Callback<usize, ElementDesc>`, `VirtualRange`. |
+| `layout` | (helpers) | `ComponentLength`, `ComponentSizing`, `ComponentInsets`, `ComponentColor` shared sizing/color enums used by the widgets. |
+
+All widgets re-export at the crate root (`use xui_components::*;`).
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`xui`, `xui-interface` (dev), `xui-text-engine` (dev), `tokio` (async image
+loading), `reqwest` (URL fetch), `zune-core`/`zune-image` (decode), `anyhow`,
+`thiserror`.
+
+## Usage
+
+```rust
+use xui::prelude::*;
+use xui_components::{button, ButtonVariant, dropdown, DropDownItem};
+
+#[xui::component]
+fn toolbar(cx: &mut HookContext) -> ElementDesc {
+    let items = use_state(cx, || vec![
+        DropDownItem::new("a", "Apple", false),
+        DropDownItem::new("b", "Banana", false),
+    ]);
+    xui! {
+        <Row style={style!(gap: 8.0)}>
+            <button variant={ButtonVariant::Primary}
+                    on_click={Callback::from(|_| { /* ... */ })}>
+                {"Save"}
+            </button>
+            <dropdown items={items.get().clone()}
+                      on_change={items.setter().map(|v| /* index */ v)} />
+        </Row>
+    }
+}
+```
+
+See [`xui-example-app`](xui-example-app.md) for full usage of every widget.

