@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@
+# `xui-example-app` — end-to-end demo
+
+A runnable application that demonstrates the full framework: the `xui!` macro,
+`#[component]` functions, the `xui-components` widget set, asset loading,
+icons (path / SVG), text, layouts, vector scenes, and the `xui-winit` Skia
+runner. This is the recommended starting point for learning the framework.
+
+## Binary
+
+`xui-example-app` (`xui-example-app/src/main.rs`).
+
+## Layout
+
+```text
+xui-example-app/
+├── Cargo.toml          # deps: xui, xui-winit (skia), xui-components, leanplot
+├── xui.toml            # [assets] source = "assets", bundle = "embedded"
+├── assets/             # packed into assets.xpak by cargo xui
+├── src/
+│   ├── main.rs         # window setup, App, runner, #[xui::main]
+│   ├── components/     # app-specific components built on xui-components
+│   └── flight_icing.rs # a demo domain module (vector scene + plot)
+└── examples/           # additional runnable examples
+```
+
+## What it shows
+
+- **App bootstrap**: `#[xui::main]`, `xui::include_assets!()`, `App::new(root)`,
+  `xui_winit::runner(app, WinitRunnerOptions::default())`. Custom window
+  attributes on macOS.
+- **Icons**: three construction styles — filled path, stroked path, and embedded
+  SVG (`IconData::from_fill` / `from_stroke` / `from_svg`), cached with a
+  `OnceLock`.
+- **Vector scenes**: `VectorSceneBuilder`, rectangles, cubic curves, colors
+  that respond to interaction state (`VectorScene`).
+- **Widgets**: `button`, `input`, `dropdown`, `tabs`, `image`, `icon`,
+  `virtual_list` from [`xui-components`](xui-components.md).
+- **Assets**: icons/images loaded through the generated `xui_assets::refs` +
+  `xui_assets::manager()`.
+- **Integration with `leanplot`** (Git dependency) for a plotted demo panel.
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`winit`, `xui`, `xui-winit` (feature `skia`), `xui-components`, `leanplot`
+(Git). Dev: `png`, `xui-skia`.
+
+## Run it
+
+From the workspace root:
+
+```sh
+cargo xui run -p xui-example-app
+```
+
+`cargo xui` packs `assets/` into a `.xpak`, generates the bootstrap module, and
+runs the binary with the `XUI_ASSETS_BOOTSTRAP` env var set. In dev, the
+`assets/` directory is also mounted live (`dev_directory = true`), so dropping
+a new image into `assets/` and re-running picks it up without a rebuild of the
+archive.
+
+To build a release bundle:
+
+```sh
+cargo xui build --release -p xui-example-app
+```

diff --git a/docs/crates/xui-interface.md b/docs/crates/xui-interface.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3acf16e
--- a/docs/crates/xui-interface.md
+++ b/docs/crates/xui-interface.md
@@ -0,0 +1,100 @@
+# `xui-interface` — shared types and contracts
+
+The zero-runtime crate every other crate agrees on. It defines the geometry,
+style, event, widget, transition, platform, and text vocabulary of the
+framework. It has no dependency on the runtime or any backend, which keeps the
+type surface stable and testable in isolation.
+
+## Public API
+
+The crate re-exports its modules' items at the root for convenience.
+
+### `core` — geometry
+
+`Color`, `Point`, `Rect`, `Size`, `Sizing`, `EdgeInsets`, `Bounds`,
+`Translation`.
+
+### `style` — the style system
+
+- Builders and patches: `Style`, `StylePatch`, `StyleMerge`, and per-layer
+  patches (`LayoutStylePatch`, `PaintStylePatch`, `TextStylePatch`,
+  `ScrollStylePatch`, `TransformStylePatch`, `EffectStylePatch`,
+  `ScrollbarStylePatch`).
+- `StyleValue<T>` (`Unset` / `Inherit` / `Initial` / `Value`).
+- Tokens: `ColorToken`, `SpacingToken`, `FontSizeToken`, `RadiusToken`.
+- Color: `ColorStyle`, `ColorValue`, `LinearGradientStyle`, `RadialGradientStyle`.
+- Effects/paint: `ShadowStyle`, `StrokeStyle`, `Stroke`, `StrokeLineStyle`,
+  `BlendMode`, `BackdropStyle`, `BackdropFilter`, `BackdropMask`, `MaskShape`,
+  `ColorMatrix`, `FilterQuality`, `Effect`, `EffectStylePatch`.
+- Layout: `AlignStyle`, `JustifyStyle`, `FlexDirectionStyle`, `PositionStyle`,
+  `ScrollDirectionStyle`, `ScrollbarStyle`, `ScrollbarVisibilityStyle`,
+  `TransformStyle`, `RadiusToken`.
+- Computed (resolved) forms: `ComputedStyle`, `ComputedLayoutStyle`,
+  `ComputedPaintStyle`, `ComputedTextStyle`, `ComputedScrollStyle`,
+  `ComputedScrollbarStyle`, `ComputedColorStyle`, `ComputedShadowStyle`,
+  `ComputedStrokeStyle`, `ComputedEffectStyle`, `ComputedBackdropStyle`, …
+- Theming/state: `Theme`, `StateStyleRule`, `WidgetStateMatcher`.
+
+### `events` — input and semantics
+
+Raw inputs (`RawWindowEvent`, `RawPointerButton`, `RawPointerMove`,
+`RawPointerCancel`, `RawKeyboard`, `RawKeyInput`, `RawWheel`, `RawIme`,
+`RawContextMenu`), pointer snapshots (`PointerSnapshot`, `PointerButton`,
+`PointerButtons`, `PointerCoords`, `PointerKind`), keyboard (`PhysicalKey`,
+`NamedKey`, `KeyState`, `KeyText`, `Modifiers`), scroll (`ScrollDelta`),
+shortcuts (`Shortcut`, `ShortcutBinding`, `ShortcutKey`, `ShortcutModifiers`),
+semantic requests (`Event`, `EventRef`, `EventRequest`, `EventRequests`,
+`EventResult`, `EventPhase`, `CommandEvent`, `CommandId`,
+`ContextMenuTrigger`, `FocusReason`), and ids (`XuiDeviceId`, `XuiPointerId`).
+
+### `widget` — widget contracts
+
+`Component`, `NodeId`, `Key`, `WidgetType`, `Focusability`, `FocusProperties`,
+`AccessibilityRole`, `AccessibilityProperties`, `NodeLifecycleEvent`.
+
+### `platform` — platform integration
+
+`PlatformOutput`, `TextInputPurpose`, `TextInputSession` (IME/clipboard hooks).
+
+### `transition` — animation timing
+
+`Easing` (linear, cubic in/out, …), `Transition` (duration, delay, easing),
+`AnimationProgress` (`raw`, `eased`, `completed`).
+
+### `text` — text traits and layout data
+
+Traits: `TextBackend`, `Shaper`, `FontDatabase`, `GlyphRasterizer`. Data:
+`ParagraphLayout`, `LineLayout`, `GlyphRun`, `TextCluster`, `GlyphInstance`,
+`TextRange`, `TextOffset`, `FontDataRef`, `FontQuery`, `FontFamily`,
+`FontWeight`, `FontStyle`, `FontStretch`, `LineHeight`, `ParagraphStyle`,
+`TextBoxStyle`, `TextOverflow`, `WhiteSpace`, `OverflowWrap`, `TextAlign`,
+`TextDirection`, `Script`, `RasterizedGlyph`, `RasterizedGlyphFormat`,
+`TextLayoutInput`, `TextLayoutConstraints`, `ComputedTextStyle`, `TextStyleId`.
+
+### `dirty` — change tracking
+
+`WidgetUpdateFlags`, `StyleDiffFlags`.
+
+### `runtime` & `render`
+
+`EventSource`, plus the re-exported render types (effects, layer descriptors).
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`bitflags`, `easer`, `fixedstr`, `num-traits`, `ordered-float`, `slotmap`,
+`smallstr`. Pure, no async, no GPU.
+
+## Usage
+
+Crates that need to speak the framework's vocabulary depend on this crate alone
+(for example, a custom text backend or a render-graph adapter). Application
+code usually reaches these types through `xui::prelude`.
+
+```rust
+use xui_interface::{Color, EdgeInsets, Easing, Transition};
+use std::time::Duration;
+
+let c = Color::rgba(0.2, 0.4, 0.8, 1.0);
+let t = Transition::new(Duration::from_millis(200))
+    .ease(Easing::CubicOut);
+```

diff --git a/docs/crates/xui-macros.md b/docs/crates/xui-macros.md
