+# `xui-render-graph` — backend-independent layer compilation
+
+Pure-Rust compilation of layer effects, backdrop filters, and masks into a
+reusable, backend-independent program. No GPU dependency, and the crate is
+`#![forbid(unsafe_code)]`.
+
+The pipeline:
+
+1. [`compile_layer`] normalizes a static `LayerGraphDescriptor` into a reusable
+   [`LayerProgram`].
+2. [`LayerProgram::instantiate`] applies frame geometry, lowers executable pass
+   IR, and assigns abstract transient texture slots — without committing to a
+   specific backend.
+3. A backend (`xui-skia` or `wgpu`) binds external resources and executes the
+   resulting [`LayerRenderPlan`].
+
+## Public API
+
+### Compilation entry points
+
+- `compile_layer(descriptor) -> Result<LayerProgram, CompileError>`
+- `LayerProgram::instantiate(ctx) -> Result<LayerRenderPlan, PlanError>`
+- `LayerProgram::fingerprint()` / `ProgramFingerprint` for caching.
+- `BoundLayerProgram` / `ExternalBindings` / `LayerMaskBinding` — bind external
+  textures/masks to a program for execution.
+
+### Inputs (`input`)
+
+`LayerGraphDescriptor`, `LayerEffect`, `BackdropDescriptor`, `BackdropFilter`,
+`CompositeDescriptor`, `CompositeInstance`, `CompositeOperator`, `Mask`,
+`MaskShape`, `ColorMatrix`, `BlendMode`, `FilterQuality`, `WorkingColorSpace`.
+
+### Program IR (`program`)
+
+`LayerProgram`, `ProgramNode`, `ProgramNodeId`, `ProgramOp`,
+`ProgramResource`/`ProgramResourceKind`/`ProgramResourceId`,
+`ExternalResourceKind`, `MaskProgram`, `SampleExpansion`,
+`ProgramFingerprint`.
+
+### Render plan (`plan`)
+
+`LayerRenderPlan`, `Pass`, `PassId`, `PassOp`, `PassUniforms`,
+`PipelineKey`, `DrawProgram`, `DrawShader`, `AttachmentBlend`,
+`PlanResource`/`PlanResourceKind`/`PlanResourceId`, `TransientSlot`/
+`TransientSlotId`, `TextureClass`, `CoordinateSpace`, `Axis`, `Extent2d`,
+`PixelRect`, `PlanMask`, `PlanLimits`, `LayerPlanContext`, `PlanStats`,
+`ExternalAliasing`, `ResourceBindings`.
+
+### Errors
+
+`CompileError`, `PlanError`, `BindingError`.
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`blake3` (fingerprinting), `thiserror`, `xui-interface` (shared effect/blend
+enums and `WorkingColorSpace`).
+
+## Usage
+
+Application code never calls this crate directly. Backends (and tests) consume
+it to turn a compiled scene into concrete draw calls. The crate's value is that
+two different GPU backends run exactly the same layer/filter logic.

