+# `xui-skia` — Skia rendering backend
+
+A `skia-safe`-based implementation of `xui::render::RenderBackend` and the
+text/glyph rasterization path. Used by default through `xui-winit`'s `skia`
+feature. On macOS it drives a Metal surface via `objc2-metal`.
+
+## Public API
+
+### `SkiaBackend`
+
+The render backend. Generic over a `TextBackend` (defaults to
+`SkiaTextBackend`).
+
+- `SkiaBackend::new(window: Arc<Window>) -> Result<Self, SkiaBackendError>`
+- `new_with_options(window, options)` — set clear color and layer-cache budget.
+- `headless(scale_factor, options)` — construct without a window (for tests /
+  offscreen rendering).
+- `frame_size_px()`, `is_gpu_accelerated()`, `layer_cache_stats()`,
+  `frame_stats()`, `read_pixels_rgba8()`.
+
+### `SkiaBackendOptions`
+
+```rust
+pub struct SkiaBackendOptions {
+    pub clear_color: Color,
+    pub layer_cache_budget_bytes: u64,
+}
+```
+
+### Text backend
+
+- `SkiaTextBackend` — implements `xui_interface::TextBackend`; owns Skia
+  typeface/paragraph state. `new(scale_factor)`, `scale_factor()`,
+  `set_scale_factor()`.
+- `SkiaFontId(pub u32)`, `SkiaGlyphKey`, `SkiaParagraphState` (caches a Skia
+  `Paragraph`).
+
+### Stats
+
+`SkiaFrameStats` (frame index, root damage rects/area, primitive/layer draws,
+render plans/passes, transient resource texels, surface alloc/reuse counts,
+…) and `SkiaLayerCacheStats` (hits/misses/entries/resident bytes/partial &
+full updates/dirty regions).
+
+### Errors
+
+`SkiaBackendError`.
+
+## Module map
+
+`backend` (the backend + options), `cache` (layer cache + stats), `damage`
+(damage region tracking), `error`, `metal` (macOS Metal surface, gated on
+`target_os = "macos"`), `stats`, `text`.
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`skia-safe` (`gpu`, `textlayout`), `softbuffer` (CPU buffer fallback),
+`memmap2`, `moka` (caching), `thiserror`, `winit`, `xui`, `xui-interface`,
+`xui-render-graph`. macOS: `objc2`, `objc2-core-foundation`, `objc2-metal`.
+
+## Usage
+
+Applications construct a `SkiaBackend` indirectly through
+[`xui-winit`](xui-winit.md). For headless rendering or tests:
+
+```rust
+use xui_skia::{SkiaBackend, SkiaBackendOptions, SkiaTextBackend};
+use xui::core::Color;
+
+let opts = SkiaBackendOptions { clear_color: Color::WHITE, layer_cache_budget_bytes: 64 * 1024 * 1024 };
+let mut backend = SkiaBackend::headless(2.0, opts);
+let pixels: Vec<u8> = backend.read_pixels_rgba8().unwrap();
+```

