+# `xui-text` — `swash`/`fontique` text stack
+
+The crate's own text shaping, layout, and rasterization implementation built on
+`swash`, `fontique`, and `etagere`. It is one of two text backends; the other is
+[`xui-text-engine`](xui-text-engine.md) (`cosmic-text`). `xui` re-exports
+`xui_text::engine::Engine` as `xui::text::Engine`.
+
+## Modules
+
+| Module | Contents |
+| --- | --- |
+| `atlas` | glyph atlas with `FontRenderBackend`; packs rasterized glyphs via `etagere`. |
+| `bidi` | bidirectional algorithm helpers; `BidiLevel`, `BidiDirection`. |
+| `doc` | rich-text document model: `SpanStyle`, `Features`, `Direction`, font/weight/stretch settings. |
+| `engine` | shaping + scale context; `Engine` (the type `xui` re-exports). |
+| `fontique_library` | system font discovery via `fontique`; `Font`, `FontContext`, `FamilyList`, `FontGroupId`. |
+| `layout` | cluster/run/line layout data; `LayoutData`, `LineData`, `ClusterData`. |
+| `line_breaker` | line breaking and `Alignment`. |
+| `par` | paragraph assembly tying together bidi/engine/layout; `Glyph`, `SpanId`. |
+| `span` | `Span` of styled elements; `SpanElement`. |
+| `typ` | run-level typography: `TextRunStyle`, `SmallString` (`arrayvec`). |
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`swash` (shaping, scaling, bidi, zeno vector outlines), `fontique` (system font
+collection + fallback), `etagere` (atlas bin-packing), `glam`, `memmap2`,
+`arrayvec`, `ordered-float`, `xui-interface`.
+
+## Usage
+
+Application code rarely touches this crate directly — the configured `TextHost`
+in `xui::app::App` selects a text backend. To use this stack explicitly, build an
+`xui_text::engine::Engine` and hand it to the runtime as a `TextBackend`.

