@@ -0,0 +1,103 @@
+# `xui` — core framework
+
+The central crate of the workspace. It provides the declarative UI runtime, the
+fiber-based reconciler, the hook system, flexbox layout, the style pipeline, the
+retained render scene, built-in widgets, and integration points for assets and
+text.
+
+Most applications depend on this crate directly and reach it through the
+[`prelude`](#prelude).
+
+## Public API
+
+Modules (re-exported where noted):
+
+| Module | Contents |
+| --- | --- |
+| `app` | `App` (owns component root, tokio runtime, scheduler, theme, text host). |
+| `runtime` | `GuiRuntime`, `ControlFlow`, `FrameReport`, `RuntimeEvent`, `QueueEventSource`. |
+| `fiber` | `FiberId`, `ComponentCall`, `ComponentRender`, `ComponentType`, `ErasedProps(Ref)`, retained fiber tree. |
+| `state` | `HookContext`, `Memo`, `Resource`, `Callback`, `AsyncValue`, `TaskContext`, `Scheduler`, `AsyncDispatcher`, `HookRef`. |
+| `lanes` | update lanes (`DEFAULT_LANE`, `RETRY_LANE`, `NO_LANES`), `current_update_lane`. |
+| `layout` | `taffy`-backed flexbox over retained spatial nodes. |
+| `style` | `Style` merging, `Theme`, `ComputedStyle`, state rules, `AnimablePaintStyle`/`AnimableStyle`. |
+| `element` | `ElementDesc`, `ComponentDesc`, `WidgetDesc`, `Component`, `IntoChildren`, `portal`. |
+| `component` | `ComponentRuntime`. |
+| `widgets` | primitive widget interface `WidgetI`, overlays (`OverlayEntryId`, `OverlayScopeId`), `text_input`. |
+| `render` | scene + compiler + `RenderBackend`/`MockRenderBackend`, `RenderNodeId`, `PictureId`, `PrimitiveId`, `SpatialNodeId`. |
+| `event_system` | `EventState`, `EventTranslator`, semantic event callbacks (`ClickEventHandler`, …). |
+| `focus` | `FocusHandle`, `FocusManager`, `FocusRequest`, `FocusTransition`. |
+| `shortcut` | `ShortcutManager`, `ShortcutRegistrationId`. |
+| `animation` | `AnimableStyle`, `AnimablePaintStyle` (see [`xui-animation`](xui-animation.md)). |
+| `transition` | re-exports interface transitions. |
+| `text` | `TextHost`, `TextLayoutSlot`, re-exports `xui_text::engine::Engine`. |
+| `assets` | `install_asset_manager` / `clear_asset_manager`, `AssetId`, `load_image_asset`, … |
+| `core` | `Color`, `Point`, `Rect`, `Size`, `EdgeInsets`, `Bounds`. |
+| `ui_runtime` | `RenderFrameError`, low-level UI runtime. |
+
+### Prelude
+
+`use xui::prelude::*;` brings in `App`, `ComponentRuntime`, the element types,
+hook context and state helpers, style and computed-style types, tokens,
+events/semantic events and callbacks, `Easing`/`Transition`, and the render
+backends. Start every app module with this import.
+
+### Macros
+
+```rust
+// Declarative element tree → ElementDesc
+let el: ElementDesc = xui! {
+    <Column style={style!(gap: 8.0)}>
+        {child_a}
+        {child_b}
+    </Column>
+};
+
+// A component function with typed props + builder
+#[xui::component]
+fn card(cx: &mut HookContext, label: &str) -> ElementDesc { /* ... */ }
+```
+
+- `xui::main` (re-exported from `xui-macros`) — wraps `fn main`, installs the
+  asset manager, and includes the bootstrap module.
+- `xui::include_assets!()` — expands the generated `xui_assets` module produced
+  by `cargo xui` (requires the `XUI_ASSETS_BOOTSTRAP` env var).
+
+## Dependencies
+
+`xui-animation`, `xui-assets`, `xui-interface`, `xui-macros`, `xui-text`,
+`slot`. External: `taffy` (flexbox), `ropey` (rope text), `moka` (cache),
+`rustc-hash`, `slotmap`, `smallstr`, `smallvec`, `bitflags`.
+
+## Usage
+
+A minimal app:
+
+```rust
+use xui::prelude::*;
+use xui_components::button;
+use xui_winit::WinitRunnerOptions;
+
+#[xui::main]
+fn main() {
+    xui::include_assets!();
+
+    let app = App::new(root);
+    xui_winit::runner(app, WinitRunnerOptions::default()).unwrap();
+}
+
+#[xui::component]
+fn root(cx: &mut HookContext) -> ElementDesc {
+    let count = use_state(cx, || 0);
+    xui! {
+        <Column style={style!(padding: 16.0, gap: 8.0)}>
+            <button on_click={count.setter().map(|c| c + 1)}>
+                {"increment"}
+            </button>
+            <text style={style!(font_size: 24.0)}>{count.get().to_string()}</text>
+        </Column>
+    }
+}
+```
+
+See [`xui-example-app`](xui-example-app.md) for a complete, runnable example.
